WEBVTT

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.370
All I can do is shake my head...

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:21.970
Yeah.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.250
They've come so far in just half a day.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:29.130
Coast of the Former Polish People's Republic 
Gdansk Base

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:29.130
The West has this level of spare firepower?

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:34.270
It makes you feel stupid, fighting BETAs 
hand-to-hand with a few TSFs.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.840
Lise, thank you.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.780
If you hadn't saved me then, I would've...

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:48.050
We're part of the same squadron. 
Of course I'm going to save you.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.900
Find out what Second Lieutenant 
Lise Hohenstein is really up to.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.570
You did well, Lise.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.030
No, I didn't...

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:03.070
But try to avoid engaging BETAs 
in CQC as much as possible.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
It's too risky.

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:07.580
As if you aren't always the first to charge in.

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:12.680
Oh, there you are!

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:16.630
So this is where you've been...

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.890
You soldiers from a useless terrorist state.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.650
Who are you?

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:05.150
German Bundeswehr 51st 
TSF Battalion, Huckebein,

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.160
Second Lieutenant Kirke Steinhoff.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:13.620
German People's Republic, 
666th TSF Squadron Schwarzesmarken,

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.960
Second Lieutenant Theodor Eberbach.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:19.700
The best East Germany has, right?

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.130
Well, I'm sure it's just propaganda.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.780
Are you trying to pick a fight?

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:28.640
Will you apologize?

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:29.940
What?

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:34.140
We took unnecessary damage 
trying to rescue you.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.150
Hägendorf's badly injured.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:39.820
Crystal was almost eaten.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.310
Apologize.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:44.900
Say you're sorry for being so incompetent.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:48.490
What? Your artillery barrage almost killed us!

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.140
Didn't you just run ahead on your own?

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:54.320
Area-suppression would've sufficed 
to get rid of a group like that.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:55.240
Really...

00:03:55.730 --> 00:04:00.010
You people haven't changed a bit 
since Operation Palaiologos.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.270
If you want to die, die on your own.

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:06.780
Don't involve us.

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.440
Shut up, bitch!

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:14.170
You people in the West only survive 
because we're protecting you!

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:16.110
So don't act like you're so great—

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:21.930
You have some nerve, for a criminal nation.

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:25.910
Quit your damn yapping, American dog!

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:28.720
You bitch!

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:33.290
Please stop! It's the BETA 
that we should be fighting!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.840
Go back home, little dog!

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:37.840
Stop it, Anett!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:41.000
We'll go home when you're all dead, reds!

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.660
Why do we have to fight?

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:46.170
We're all Germans!

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.970
Don't compare me to her!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:50.470
That's enough.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:55.980
M-Major?

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.730
For crying out loud... What are you doing?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:05.290
I'm Major Joachim Balck, 
leader of the Huckebein battalion.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:07.410
Sorry about Kirke here.

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:10.440
It must be fate that you two fought.

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.480
Get along with her from now on.

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.250
As fellow Germans.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:28.760
Operation Palaiologos.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:35.270
That was a large-scale counterattack 
against the BETA in 1978, right?

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:41.320
Humanity's first attempt at infiltrating 
a BETA hive, and a historic defeat.

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:45.650
Ever since then, humanity has 
been losing to the BETA.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:46.890
Yeah.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:51.620
Sorry to call you out at this hour.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.540
I heard you got into a fight 
with a West German pilot.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:59.290
Listening to them, I understood 
exactly how we're viewed.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:02.800
Can we fight alongside the West?

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:06.590
It's true that the West doesn't trust us.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:10.050
So we need to restore that trust.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:13.510
Laserjagd performed with a few elite units.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:16.290
Camps built with minimal supplies.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.970
Our accumulated experience fighting the BETA.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:24.070
If we can show the world that we're 
a valuable force against the BETA,

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:27.320
we may be able to build a new future.

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:28.860
A future?

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:31.310
Is that what yesterday's charge was for?

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:35.050
Even so, the comrade lieutenant 
caused us some trouble.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:39.830
Why is she so obsessed with 
our country's reputation?

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.350
The military is participating in this operation

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:46.210
to overcome our political 
disadvantage against the Stasi.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:51.220
They want to perform well in this mission, 
to prove the military's superiority.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.970
So, in the end, it's just a power struggle 
between the military and Stasi?

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.850
How's Hohenstein?

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:00.080
Nothing yet...

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:03.730
But right now, if nothing else, 
I don't think she's an enemy.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:07.230
Having that knowledge is enough.

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:09.110
Good work.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.450
Keep at it tomorrow.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:29.290
What do I do?

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:34.930
The BETA echelon is forming a second wave.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.550
There are approximately forty thousand.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:44.100
The Warsaw Pact forces will stop their advance 
head-on here, at the southern coast.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.650
Why are we doing something so dangerous?

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:47.380
Let me finish!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.880
We'll take the center.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:51.470
The Americans will take the right flank.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:54.010
And the EU Army will take the left.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:58.730
While we delay the enemy, 
they'll deploy heavy-metal clouds,

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:01.710
and surround and destroy them 
with area-suppression attacks.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:06.170
This is the anti-BETA surround-and-destroy 
strategy known as "active defense."

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:09.290
Since the Laser-classes will be 
overwhelmed by sheer force,

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:11.130
there's nothing for us to do.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:14.180
Our job will be delaying and 
defending near the front lines.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:18.780
Why is the West so focused on area-suppression?

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:21.840
To eliminate the BETA as safely as possible.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:24.410
Don't you think there's another reason?

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:29.420
The West's pilots have little experience 
fighting the BETA up close.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:32.270
They want to be as safe as they can.

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:35.310
Then, if the area-suppression attack fails?

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:36.990
It can't be allowed to fail!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:41.790
Our country's reputation depends 
on this operation's success!

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:44.670
I hope it goes well.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.380
Active defense, huh?

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:53.870
It's a terrible plan, right?

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:56.860
It means they're using us as decoys, doesn't it?

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:58.900
It will be dangerous everywhere.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.140
You're so calm.

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:05.130
When they said all those terrible things 
to us yesterday, you held back.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:09.830
It's not good to talk to the West, Brother.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:12.440
If someone informs on you again...

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:16.660
You won't be able to do anything 
if you're so afraid of the Stasi.

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:21.570
We need the West's help to fight the BETA.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.200
Even if they're not very nice.

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.670
Maybe so, but...

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:31.420
And we're the best TSF 
squadron East Germany has.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.960
As long as we can be used for propaganda,

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.470
the National People's Army will protect us.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:41.930
Do you plan on fighting the Stasi?

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:44.730
Why are you asking that?

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:48.770
Because you're telling me not 
to be afraid of the Stasi.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.930
I'm not that reckless.

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:55.640
I can't let myself be destroyed, 
because I must protect my homeland.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:57.620
That's all there is to it.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:09:59.620
Can I believe you?

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:01.350
Yeah.

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:04.620
Okay.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:13.460
Gdansk Bay

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:17.220
Flagship of the GDR Navy 
<i>Karl Marx</i>

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.560
Observation satellites have confirmed

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:18.440
the second wave of the 
BETA echelon is advancing.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.590
They've reached twenty meters 
off the southern coast.

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:44.620
Former Polish People's Republic Territory 
Malbork

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:44.620
What is this?

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:48.620
A surround-and-destroy operation 
of this size, and it worked?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.480
This is the difference between us and the West?

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:53.880
That explains why they got angry.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.240
They far surpass us in 
both tactics and strength.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:02.840
Does the West really need our help?

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:26.630
Area-suppression was a success.

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:29.290
Over 70% of the BETAs have been eliminated.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.620
This is the right way...

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:32.290
This is...

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:37.000
Charging BETAs with only eight TSFs is insane.

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:39.160
Looks like we cleaned them up.

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:40.470
We're heading back to base.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:41.400
Roger.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:45.010
M-Major!

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:46.770
This is UN Command.

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:50.090
A new BETA echelon has appeared farther inland.

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:52.930
A third wave is heading 
toward the southern coast.

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:56.060
They'll make contact with the 
EU Army in thirty minutes.

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:59.320
No... They came from outside our active defense?

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:01.440
How's artillery fire working?

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:02.390
No effect.

00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:04.810
It appears to have been shot 
down by Laser-classes.

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.320
Heavy-metal cloud density dropping!

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:08.940
The West are fools!

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:12.160
They thought tricks would 
work against the BETA?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.610
They came from outside our encirclement?

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:17.380
This isn't going the way we wanted.

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.370
Comrade Lieutenant,

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:23.940
there's no need to say what we must do, right?

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:26.010
You can't mean a laserjagd?

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:29.470
Our mission is to stand by 
and await further orders!

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.550
We haven't been given anything more!

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:36.610
We've always chosen to save 
the greatest number of lives.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.820
Right now, we must choose to 
save the lives of the EU forces!

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.990
But with heavy-metal cloud density so low...

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:47.650
I'm sure if we had concentrated fire 
from the entire surface fleet,

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:51.080
we could keep the Laser-classes busy.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:55.590
And the Jolly Rogers have 
their Phoenix missiles.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.520
With their help, we can tilt 
the odds in our favor.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:02.020
Y-You want us to ask the West for help?

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:03.030
The other way around.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.220
We'll help the West.

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:07.540
There's no way they'll...

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:11.930
UN Command to Warsaw Pact 666th TSF Squadron.

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:14.270
Confirm your status.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:20.340
This is the 666th TSF Squadron's 
commander, Irisdina Bernhard.

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:22.090
There's no need to answer that!

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:24.440
The 666th TSF Squadron is to remain standing by.

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:27.050
You understand, Lieutenant Jeckeln?

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:27.950
Major...

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:31.340
The fault for this operation's 
failure lies with the West.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:33.370
Make them pay the price.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.140
B-But...

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:38.040
666th TSF Squadron to UN HQ.

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:42.320
We have lost no units and are in good condition.

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:43.710
Y-You can't...

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:49.470
Only an experienced laserjagd 
unit like ours can solve this.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:50.840
S-Silence!

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:53.380
My orders speak for the party!

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:56.650
Lieutenant Jeckeln, 
strip her of command authority!

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:57.950
Immediately!

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:00.430
I... I can't do that, Major.

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:05.280
We're only the strongest unit in East 
Germany because she leads us!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.840
If we lose her, we could be destroyed!

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:09.990
I don't care!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:12.070
The party's political reputation

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:14.950
is far more important than 
the loss of a TSF squadron!

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:17.550
But I...

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:18.390
They're here!

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:19.480
Fire!

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.290
No! I'm out of ammo!

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:25.920
Tank Division 9 to command post.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.190
We can't hold any longer. Withdrawing!

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:31.040
Negative. Defend the front lines at all costs.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:33.260
We're out of ammo!

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:35.010
Are you telling us to die?

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:39.510
Your loyalty will be remembered forever.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.660
To hell with that!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:51.200
Comrade Lieutenant, are you okay with this?

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:55.080
At this rate, the BETA will just crush us all!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:58.290
It doesn't matter if they're East or West, 
or in the National People's Army.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:02.040
We're here to save as many lives as possible!

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:06.710
If you're a member of the 666th TSF 
Squadron, you should know that!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.310
That's...

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:12.010
What do you want to do, 
Lieutenant Gretel Jeckeln?

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:16.930
What is it you should do? What's really right?

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.680
Use your head for once!

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:38.330
Don't regret talking that way 
to a political commissar later.

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:42.260
Comrade Major, please leave this to me.

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:43.710
Wh-What?

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:46.960
Let's go, comrades!

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:51.940
We are the 666th TSF Squadron, 
East Germany's best!

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:53.720
The Schwarzesmarken!

00:15:53.720 --> 00:16:00.230
Show those damn aliens and those useless 
Westerners what we can do!

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.230
All units, initiate jump.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.950
Follow me!

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:07.250
Roger!

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:13.660
Stop them! Now!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.390
Oh, are you really sure about that?

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:16.950
What?

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:23.500
They're heading into desperate battle to 
save their allies from the West's failure.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.850
And without heavy-metal cloud support.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:29.630
You couldn't ask for better propaganda.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:32.630
Do you still want to stop them?

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:34.880
W-Well...

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.390
This is UN Command.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:41.070
The US Jolly Rogers unit will 
rendezvous with you soon.

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:45.250
But the Laser-classes are at the echelon's rear, 
and getting good intel is difficult.

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:49.550
Their GPS-guided missiles are unusable.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:52.680
So we need to take the lead, correct?

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:53.650
Indeed.

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:56.280
As soon as the Laser-classes 
have been eliminated,

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.750
we will commence an artillery 
area-suppression attack.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.450
Get out of there immediately.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.130
Good luck.

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:04.890
Attention, all units.

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:08.210
We will now initiate a laserjagd.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.960
This is a suicide mission.

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:13.700
Therefore, Second Lieutenant Krzasińska

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:17.140
and Second Lieutenant Waldheim 
will stay behind in reserve.

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.550
Wh-What do you mean?

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.340
We cannot allow the entire unit to be wiped out.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.420
But there won't be enough units!

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:28.150
Katia, you have something you want to do, right?

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:31.320
We'll come back alive.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.340
Theodor...

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.630
Schwarzes-05, roger.

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.960
07 and I will withdraw.

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:41.300
Please be safe!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.530
Everything's ready.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:47.270
Now we're in this together.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.020
I don't plan on getting along with you!

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:51.810
I only did what I thought was right!

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:55.920
That's the comrade lieutenant I know.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.390
Allies to our rear.

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:01.760
It's the Jolly Rogers.

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:03.610
Okay, all units!

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:04.900
Follow me!

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:05.850
Roger!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:17.280
Damn it! I didn't know last-generation 
TSFs could move that fast!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.950
The Beast Numbers are crazy!

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:27.460
There they are!

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.710
Jolly Rogers, those are the Laser-classes.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:32.040
Roger. Thanks for guiding us here.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:34.790
All units, release Phoenix locks.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.490
Give 'em all you've got!

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:38.130
Yes, sir!

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:55.980
What?

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.370
F-Fort-class?

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.550
Jesus...

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.580
We're going in, Theodor!

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:10.750
Roger!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:12.040
Brother!

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.540
Damn it!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.010
Crap!

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:32.190
Theodor, reach out and grab

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.020
the future.

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:37.050
Irisdina!

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:51.990
Brother, go!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.260
Theodor, how many Laser-classes?

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:08.640
Twenty left!

00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:10.390
Seventeen left!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:11.940
Twelve left!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.060
Ten!

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:13.690
Eight!

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:14.850
Five!

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:15.440
Three!

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:17.190
Just one left!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.240
Brother!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:33.830
Don't mess with humanity!

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:42.190
Area-suppression complete.

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:44.010
Excellent work. Return to base.

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:49.060
Are you awake, Theodor?

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.140
Katia?

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:56.670
You'd better be grateful.

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:59.900
We pulled you out just before 
the area-suppression hit.

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:01.730
You moron.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:04.750
I wouldn't let them do that to my comrades.

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:07.030
Like you weren't out of ammo and crying.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:09.090
Shut up, dork!

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:11.230
Hold them tight.

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.620
Our heroes are coming home.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:16.390
Did we win?

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:17.450
Yeah!

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:19.880
But how did we get out?

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:24.030
A certain stupid girl convinced the West.

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:28.130
Everyone helped.

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:31.000
It didn't matter if we were East or West.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:32.890
We all worked together.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.360
I see.

00:23:16.300 --> 00:23:17.770
Major...

00:23:17.770 --> 00:23:19.370
Major Hannibal...

00:23:19.770 --> 00:23:24.880
I protected what you left behind.

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:35.030
Looks like she's told us everything, 
Director Schmidt.

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:39.520
Good work, Major Beatrix Brehme.

00:23:39.880 --> 00:23:42.070
Yes, it truly was...

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:51.570
Good work.

00:23:51.760 --> 00:23:55.750
<b>To Be Continued</b>
